r  like seven or eight months like well if  I can't talk  is there a point in coming back and not  being able to say anything I want to  come back because I want to come back  there's no point in me just talking for  10 minutes of the camera about how I  wish I could say something when I really  can't so I'm gonna leave it at that  thank you so much for your patience or  if you've stuck around for nine months  just waiting I really appreciate it  according to our source along with  YouTube olivia is also focusing on her  social circle  she and sister Bella are expected to  spend New Year's Eve with their friends  [Music]
 

